              "name": "CookingWithShelia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I liked the recipe...it was simple, not a lot of ingredients and easy to make. However, the recipe was not clear on whether this was a frozen drink or to be served over ice...it was not clear on the use of ice. Also I wasn't real sure what to do with the blueberries.\n\nThe 1st batch I made according to recipe. The second batch, I made a watermelon basil simple syrup and I added a splash of watermelon liquor.",
